   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "Are you just here to scare me forever?",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s12b09.wav",
   "end": 167.439,
   "sfx": [
    "sob"
   ]
  },
  "s12b10": {
   "scene": "s12",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 168.039,
   "end": 170.439
  },
  "s12b11": {
   "scene": "s12",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 170.439,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the Void did not move. It stood there.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s12b11.wav",
   "end": 174.887
  },
  "s13b01": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 176.037,
   "end": 181.237,
   "sfx": [
    "rumble_low",
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s13b02": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 181.237,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "This is it.",
   "inner": true,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s13b02.wav",
   "end": 182.294,
   "sfx": [
    "heartbeat"
   ]
  },
  "s13b03": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 182.894,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "My fear thought the Void had had enough of its complaining, and would destroy it.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s13b03.wav",
   "end": 188.116,
   "sfx": [
    "heartbeat",
    "breath_shaky"
   ]
  },
  "s13b04": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 189.316,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "But then, my fear felt a hand on its shoulder.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s13b04.wav",
   "end": 192.78,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s13b05": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 192.98,
   "end": 196.28
  },
  "s13b06": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 196.28,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And it looked up, into the face of the Void.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s13b06.wav",
   "end": 199.388
  },
  "s14b01": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 200.338,
   "end": 203.338,
   "sfx": [
    "shimmer",
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s14b02": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 203.338,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And instead of darkness, my fear saw the twinkling of lights.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b02.wav",
   "end": 207.584,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s14b03": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 208.084,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Like galaxies, and nebulae, and stars of the universe.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b03.wav",
   "end": 211.693,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s14b04": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 212.193,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The Void, filled with bits and pieces of meaning.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b04.wav",
   "end": 215.128,
   "sfx": [
    "shimmer"
   ]
  },
  "s14b05": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 215.528,
   "end": 219.928
  },
  "s14b06": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 219.928,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And for once, my fear wasn't afraid. It felt wonder, and amazement.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b06.wav",
   "end": 226.485,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s14b07": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 226.985,
   "end": 229.585
  },
  "s14b08": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 229.585,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "Why are you showing me this?",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b08.wav",
   "end": 231.264
  },
  "s14b09": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 231.864,
   "end": 236.064,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s14b10": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 236.064,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the Void stared into the screen of my consciousness.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s14b10.wav",
   "end": 239.648
  },
  "s15b01": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 240.598,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "My other emotions were looking back.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s15b01.wav",
   "end": 242.989
  },
  "s15b02": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 243.289,
   "end": 247.289
  },
  "s15b03": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 247.289,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "They smiled, just for a moment, then went back to helping me.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s15b03.wav",
   "end": 251.705,
   "sfx": [
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s16b01": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 252.655,
   "end": 254.655,
   "sfx": [
    "breath_shaky"
   ]
  },
  "s16b02": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 254.655,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Then my fear felt the gentle push of the Void.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s16b02.wav",
   "end": 257.599,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle",
    "footsteps"
   ]
  },
  "s16b03": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 258.099,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The Void stood there, with galaxies twinkling in its dark facade.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s16b03.wav",
   "end": 263.369,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s16b04": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 263.669,
   "end": 267.869
  },
  "s17b01": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 268.319,
   "end": 270.719
  },
  "s17b02": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 270.719,
   "end": 272.319
  },
  "s17b03": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 272.319,
   "speaker": "CONSCIOUSNESS",
   "text": "Fear.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s17b03.wav",
   "end": 272.851
  },
  "s17b04": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 273.751,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "Can I help?",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s17b04.wav",
   "end": 274.676
  },
  "s17b05": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 275.076,
   "end": 280.076,
   "sfx": [
    "footsteps",
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s18b01": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 280.976,
   "end": 282.276,
   "sfx": [
    "rust_creak"
   ]
  },
  "s18b02": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 282.276,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The old cage had rusted, its gate hanging open.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s18b02.wav",
   "end": 286.169
  },
  "s18b03": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 286.669,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "But that was just a small detail.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s18b03.wav",
   "end": 288.987
  },
  "s19b01": {
   "scene": "s19",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 290.387,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Because the scene changed, to my emotions at the console.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s19b01.wav",
   "end": 294.091,
   "sfx": [
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s19b02": {
   "scene": "s19",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 294.491,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the Void, standing in the background.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s19b02.wav",
   "end": 296.785
  },
  "s19b03": {
   "scene": "s19",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 297.185,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "I could barely see that rusty cage anymore, in the back of my mind.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav_play/s19b03.wav",
   "end": 302.633,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s20b01": {
